  "title": "isobus: Reassemble Transport Protocol BAM sessions",
  "description": "BAM (TP.CM control byte 0x20) never registered a fragment identifier or\nseeded the reassembly engine, so every following TP.DT emitted \"ERROR:\nTransport protocol was not initialized\" instead of reassembling.\n\nApply the same fragment-table setup the RTS path (control byte 0x10)\nalready uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Nebojša Cvetković <nebkat@gmail.com>\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude)",
